Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kira Kosuke, age fourteen.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.45,0:00:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran away from home and his abusive father.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.75,0:00:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Started with pickpocketing and larceny,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.59,0:00:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,ended up killing, then raping, three women.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing then raping?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.78,0:00:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it the other way?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the report's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.34,0:00:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks cute, but he's a psycho.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.39,0:00:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Age fourteen, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be a big deal.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.05,0:00:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I just heard that Natsume Soichi's going to be his lawyer.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.49,0:00:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Natsume?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.85,0:00:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That over-compassionate hotshot?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.82,0:00:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He supposedly talked the dad into letting him.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard just wants the attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be one hell of a trial.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.48,0:01:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Depending on the psych eval, he may not be in long at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.78,0:01:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell if I care.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.24,0:01:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the laws protecting minors,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.37,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't do a thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.95,0:01:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.62,0:01:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.97,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That little bastard...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.09,0:01:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's grinning.
