Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.99,0:02:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninety-five...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.75,0:02:57.88,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Ninety-six.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.89,0:02:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were here?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.65,0:02:59.52,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Ninety-seven.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.55,0:03:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.03,0:03:02.03,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Ninety-eight.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.87,0:03:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninety-nine.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.03,0:03:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.45,0:03:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Natsume.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.87,0:03:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,These frogs are all over the place.
