Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.89,0:03:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty gross, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.38,blood,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,696)\fsp9\blur8.25\alpha&64&\fs147\fscy110\t(67,151,\blur7.5\c&HB8B678&)\t(152,193,\fsp18\c&H9391B2&)\t(194,234,\fsp9\c&HFDFBF0&)\t(235,276,\fsp18\c&H9391B2&)\t(277,318,\fsp9\c&HFDFBF0&)\t(1527,1611,\fsp30\blur12)\t(1612,1652,\fsp6)\t(1653,1694,\fscy150\fsp9)\t(1695,1736,\fscy110)}Best in the World
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.01,0:03:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with killing living things?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.39,0:03:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel sorry for them?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.94,0:03:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how small they are, they're still alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.95,0:03:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel sorry? Why would I?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.08,0:03:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans kill pigs and cows to eat,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.44,0:03:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're supposed to feel bad about a few frogs?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.91,0:03:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing something to eat and doing it for pure amusement are two very different things.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.82,0:03:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.39,0:03:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.49,0:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is, if nobody cares, why can't I?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.62,0:03:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's wrong is wrong!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.64,0:04:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you're not stupid, so shouldn't you know that?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.03,0:04:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That again?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.13,0:04:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You grown-ups always get bored halfway\Nthrough your explanations and give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.65,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw that yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.90,0:04:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing drops at regular intervals.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.42,0:04:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be supplies or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.32,0:04:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna check it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know what will happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.58,0:04:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's bring your father too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.74,0:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.48,0:04:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mind talking back to me,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.26,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but the minute your father comes up, you don't say a word.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.81,0:04:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That attitude of yours is what makes him so violent.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.96,0:04:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You should show him how you feel.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.01,0:04:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.63,0:04:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.87,0:04:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a little difficult to get up there.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.28,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a bomb.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.26,0:05:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ones are better suited for this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.78,0:05:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This how you use it?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.07,0:05:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.35,0:05:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't working.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.68,0:05:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems only their owner can trigger them.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke, you do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.61,0:05:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on it, already!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.13,0:05:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you're just scaring him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.34,0:05:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up already!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.93,0:05:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.65,0:05:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.32,0:05:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's dangerous, get back.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.25,0:06:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what we've got here!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.31,0:06:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.58,0:06:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Instant ramen, canned food, a flashlight, and even beer!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.23,0:06:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.97,0:06:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who wants to eat, follow me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mr. Kira...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.25,0:06:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That belongs to all of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We should divide it between us right here!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.34,0:06:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This was {\i1}my{\i0} idea, and {\i1}my{\i0} son got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.76,0:06:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.80,0:06:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.41,0:06:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.08,0:06:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Out here, there ain't no rules and ain't no police.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.91,0:06:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It don't matter squat if you're a lawyer.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.00,0:06:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you're just a useless mouth to feed.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong rule the weak.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.70,0:06:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the law of the jungle.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.63,0:07:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.43,0:07:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Scum...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.85,0:07:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You say something?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.19,0:07:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna talk back to me? Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.91,0:07:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you need some special attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.99,0:07:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to help you remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.67,0:07:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Achievement Unlocked: \NForty Hours of Continuous Play."
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.61,0:07:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You skipped school to play that game again?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.22,0:07:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't show-up your parents like this!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.81,0:07:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think feeds you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.45,0:07:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.62,0:08:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.42,0:08:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kira!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shirt! Take off your shirt!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.04,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.73,0:08:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke! You—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.93,0:08:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Natsume!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.04,0:08:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it! I showed him how I felt, just like you told me to!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.05,0:08:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the first time I've ever fought back!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Natsume, you'll protect me again, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.17,0:08:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm insane, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.34,0:08:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was abused, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.83,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I just killed him, and I...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel wonderful!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.05,0:09:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault, Dad.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.29,0:09:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't give me a choice.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.61,0:09:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be my lawyer again, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.88,0:09:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll tell everyone at the trial, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.17,0:09:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.78,0:09:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should've agreed to be your lawyer!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.55,0:09:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're human garbage.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.30,0:09:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're defective, raised wrong!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.78,0:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The father was bad, but his son's even worse!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.85,0:09:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you stay on this island forever!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.46,0:09:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd protect me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.09,0:09:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.73,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Radar?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.53,0:09:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.56,0:10:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And how can someone be here without showing up on sonar?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's just like {\i0}BTOOOM!'s {\i1}system.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.10,0:10:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sonar only locates people who are moving.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.44,0:10:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what happened this morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.75,0:10:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wasn't moving, so she didn't see me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.34,0:10:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it happened to me this time, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.16,0:10:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That corpse doesn't look like\Nthe result of an explosion.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.17,0:10:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did he do?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.32,0:10:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.68,0:10:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He deserved to die.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.37,0:10:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.68,0:10:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no police or rules here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.05,0:10:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lawyers are just mouths to feed.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.01,0:10:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's survival of the fittest.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.72,0:10:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong rule the weak.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.57,0:10:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the law of the jungle.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.53,0:10:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't do what I say,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.42,0:10:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll end up like him.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.53,0:10:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, and hear me out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.99,0:10:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me what to do?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone doesn't listen to\Nwhat you tell them to do...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.88,0:11:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...they need special attention, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.38,0:11:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.65,0:11:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.74,0:11:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm taking your BIMs and the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.11,0:11:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gross, Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.38,0:11:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.58,0:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Running won't help you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.57,0:11:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this world...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.74,0:11:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is just like {\i1}BTOOOM!, {\i0}and I'm super-good at it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.88,0:11:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He used his sonar.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.05,0:11:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he going to follow us?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.31,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.22,0:11:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep running like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.27,0:11:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.62,0:11:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.55,0:11:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't kill any more people!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.96,0:11:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.69,0:11:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.89,0:11:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I just tripped a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.24,0:12:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.77,0:12:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.24,0:12:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.92,0:12:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me here.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.52,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you leave me, you'll survive.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.30,0:12:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Get going.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.36,0:12:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Taira can't run.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.60,0:12:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to do something.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.14,0:12:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But... do I really have to risk my own life
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.13,0:12:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for some old guy I just met?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.30,0:12:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, hide here.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.61,0:12:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't move, he'll never find you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.26,0:12:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll draw him away.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.28,0:12:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can run while I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.54,0:12:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to fight him?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.92,0:12:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.22,0:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach him a lesson, take his BIMs,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.38,0:13:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and that'll be the end of this.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.41,0:13:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.76,0:13:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can do this.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.13,0:13:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm one of the best{\i0} BTOOOM! {\i1}players in the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.20,0:13:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.55,0:13:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,About fifty meters away?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.03,0:13:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to judge distances \Nthat well until I get used to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.86,0:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his sonar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.45,0:13:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's after the case.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.94,0:13:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him have it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.16,0:13:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He used it again.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.96,0:13:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confident that I won't lose to any adults here.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.67,0:13:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you who's the strongest, \Nand who has to listen to who.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.52,0:13:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Again...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.75,0:13:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That brat, he's carefully judging the distance \Nbetween us and getting closer.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.70,0:13:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He knows how to use his radar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.89,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The kid has two types of BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.00,0:13:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're on equal terms.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.63,0:13:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What kind of BIMs does he have?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.34,0:13:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Timers?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.35,0:14:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crackers?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.91,0:14:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.86,0:14:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's close!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.85,0:14:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.81,0:14:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to get farther away.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.36,0:14:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.98,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.08,0:14:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to get closer!{Maybe split this line?\i1}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.86,0:14:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I get him?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.88,0:14:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.18,0:14:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The kid and I were thinking the same thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.67,0:14:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he used the BIM on landing, a suggested tactic?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.29,0:14:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That settles it...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.83,0:14:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's a {\i0}BTOOOM! {\i1}player.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And with a three-star rank.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.94,0:14:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm a{\i0\i1} four-star{\i1} player!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.52,0:14:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's a{\i0} BTOOOM!{\i1} player.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.43,0:14:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Standard tactics won't \Nwork on either of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.66,0:14:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.65,0:14:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so much fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We collect these, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.48,0:15:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sakamoto, don't die, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.21,0:15:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.76,0:15:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has cracker BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.91,0:15:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's the other type?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.91,0:15:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.07,0:15:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not gonna fight back?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.65,0:15:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared already?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.07,0:15:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to think before I attack.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.32,0:15:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to set a trap.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is boring. You're just running.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.71,0:15:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't disappoint me, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.36,0:15:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You think a lame-ass trap \Nlike that will beat me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.58,0:15:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That wasn't the real attack.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.51,0:15:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He'll attack...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.77,0:15:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}from the front!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.02,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be that easy!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.21,0:16:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullseye!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.40,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.70,0:16:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An implosion type?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That would've killed me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.39,0:16:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Completely...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.66,0:16:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a {\i1}BTOOOM! {\i0}player, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.45,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So come on, fight me for real.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.76,0:16:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good at the game, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.11,0:16:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.18,0:16:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't plan on killing me, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.10,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can settle this {\i1}without{\i0} killing me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.76,0:16:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell how naïve you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.85,0:16:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell a lot of things.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.06,0:16:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good at the game,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.71,0:16:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I bet you suck at real life.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.41,0:16:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a stupid kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.29,0:17:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you never leave your room!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.42,0:17:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The way to do it is just to think of one like the other.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.83,0:17:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Live real life like a game!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.54,0:17:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so strong 'cause we treat the game like our life, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.53,0:17:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We beat everyone else, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.68,0:17:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your problem is that you hold back in real life.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.91,0:17:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Live life boldly, just like a game!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.91,0:17:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a kid who can't tell the two apart.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.95,0:17:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit talking like you actually know something!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.11,0:17:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.28,0:17:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to say something, show yourself first.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.00,0:17:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking big while you hide...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.35,0:17:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure sounds like an online gamer.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.48,0:17:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you really are NEET!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.82,0:17:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.48,0:17:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel like fighting now?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.58,0:17:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crackers and timers, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.97,0:18:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.09,0:18:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.88,0:18:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just now, was I playing the game in my room?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.44,0:18:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.55,0:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a game.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.83,0:18:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It isn't real.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.86,0:18:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This whole setup smells like bull.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.02,0:18:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can prove it, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The flames aren't even hot.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.64,0:18:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But strangely, my senses are really sharp.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.03,0:18:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the feeling I always have.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.48,0:18:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like I'm watching myself from behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.44,0:18:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A feeling that belongs to me alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.94,0:18:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There he is!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.14,0:18:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's he thinking?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.10,0:19:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're wide open!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.36,0:19:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.56,0:19:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.23,0:19:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,An empty pouch?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.79,0:19:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.48,0:19:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.24,0:19:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running low on BIMs, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.17,0:19:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish this with the next one.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.40,0:19:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No response?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.00,0:19:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You stopped moving, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.73,0:19:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, I can tell you're hiding there.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.48,0:19:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A trick like that can't fool me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.87,0:19:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns! It burns!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.80,0:19:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's serious!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.25,0:19:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was going to kill me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.24,0:19:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.74,0:19:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.27,0:19:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He never stopped back there.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.94,0:19:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He kept moving!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.65,0:20:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But then why... Why didn't the sonar work?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.14,0:20:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The sonar's working fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.97,0:20:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-It can't be...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.10,0:20:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Finally figured it out, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.97,0:20:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.01,0:20:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Radar canceling.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.02,0:20:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have a habit of firing your \Nsonar every time you use a BIM.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.46,0:20:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I use mine at the same time, I can cancel it out...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.60,0:20:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you can't see me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.37,0:20:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can read your mind!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I still can't see him?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.13,0:20:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.17,0:20:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He can't be canceling me every time!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.28,0:20:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one's that pro.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.62,0:20:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I imagining it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.95,0:20:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he just hiding somewhere?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.55,0:20:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he's really radar canceling, where is he?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he moving?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.59,0:20:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he hiding?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.86,0:20:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've got no idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Got you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.68,0:21:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.56,0:21:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.21,0:21:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm one of the best players in the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.16,0:21:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.50,0:21:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is real!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.68,0:21:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-It's not a game.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.76,0:21:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was just about...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.98,0:21:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to kill someone again?
