Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.66,0:23:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you totally had me figured out.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:17.01,0:23:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.43,0:23:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A genius.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.85,0:23:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do without...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.18,0:23:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,your compliments.{split}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.68,0:23:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking your BIMs and the trunk.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.67,0:23:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.56,0:23:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I left you something to eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.97,0:23:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.72,0:23:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna tell me your name before you go?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:36.56,0:23:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:39.82,0:23:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:41.97,0:23:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.20,0:23:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.28,0:23:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:50.71,0:23:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only Japanese player in the top-ten?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.91,0:23:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i0\i1}That {\i1}Sakamoto?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.10,0:24:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.93,0:24:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This island rocks!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.80,0:24:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone we knew sent us to this island.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.17,0:24:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted us to disappear.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.92,0:24:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Our own society abandoned us.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.24,0:24:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just us...
